sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as TrustyAI / LMEval Operator
    participant Job as lmes-job Container<br/>(LMEvalAdapter)
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap<br/>/meta/job.json
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Model as Model Inference Endpoint<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Operator,Job: Flow 1: Standard Evaluation
        Operator->>Job: Create Kubernetes Job<br/>(K8s RBAC)
        Job->>ConfigMap: Read job specification<br/>(filesystem mount)
        Job->>EvalHub: POST status: "running"<br/>TLS / Provider credentials
        Job->>HF: GET tokenizer + datasets<br/>TLS / HF_TOKEN (optional)
        HF-->>Job: Model configs, datasets
        loop For each benchmark task
            Job->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>TLS / Bearer OPENAI_API_KEY
            Model-->>Job: Completion response
        end
        Job->>Job: Compute metrics<br/>(scikit-learn)
        Job->>EvalHub: POST results<br/>TLS / Provider credentials
        Job->>OCI: Push evaluation artifacts<br/>TLS / Username:Password
        Job->>EvalHub: POST status: "complete"<br/>TLS / Provider credentials
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Operator,Job: Flow 2: Disconnected/Air-Gapped
        Operator->>Job: Create Kubernetes Job<br/>(K8s RBAC)
        Job->>ConfigMap: Read job specification
        Note over Job: Auto-detect /test_data mount<br/>Set HF_DATASETS_OFFLINE=1<br/>HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1
        Job->>Job: Load tokenizer + datasets<br/>from /test_data (local files)
        loop For each benchmark task
            Job->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>TLS / Bearer OPENAI_API_KEY
            Model-->>Job: Completion response
        end
        Job->>Job: Compute metrics
        Job->>EvalHub: POST results<br/>TLS / Provider credentials
        Note over Job,OCI: OCI push skipped in<br/>disconnected mode
    end
